Glass lens
Source: https://github.com/leishifu666/LeiBox/tree/main/src/lib/Glass
Original author: David Haz / Canvas UI, https://canvasui.dev/docs/components/glass
Copyright (c) 2026 David Haz. MIT + Commons Clause; complete terms in glass/LICENSE.
GlassVanilla.ts, canvas-viewport.ts, html-in-canvas.ts and rect-cache.ts retain the upstream renderer/capture implementation. Local changes handle strict TypeScript checks, composite ancestor background colors before snapshot capture, refresh capture on theme changes, and expose renderer lifecycle state. The React wrapper keeps interactive DOM outside canvas, uses the upstream DOM snapshot fallback and disables rendering for coarse pointers/reduced motion or unavailable WebGL.

